quenta }{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-4\cf1\cgrid tuttavia lo studio del}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\cf1\cgrid l}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-4\super\cf1\cgrid '}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-4\cf1\cgrid amica Emma Jeker e ne segue certo}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\cf1\cgrid  con qualc
he rimpianto l}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\super\cf1\cgrid '}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\cf1\cgrid attivit\'e0 di pittrice, dalla "II }{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-4\cf1\cgrid Quadriennale di Rom}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\cf1\cgrid a}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-4\super\cf1
